<div class="section_content content" id="7683310_content" title-footnotes="1"><div class="footnotes"><div class="footnote" id="ft7683310-1"><a class="footnoterefnum" href="#ref7683310-1">[1]</a><div class="ftpara">Editor's Note: Former §§ 231-111, Extension of compliance time, and 231-112, Transfer of ownership, were repealed 4-16-2001 by Ord. No. 4.11.01.</div></div></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h3"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7683311 child"
